title: '? An owner that reads the commits another made in its territory keeps its map true at little cost.'
pid: c0df699f-2376-409f-89f9-7274b0c5a1b6
body: |2-
  Trial: at Cleo's next mission, she reads Vic's 62facc71 and 844cf536
  and says what in her map they made false. If nothing, and the reading
  was long, the step costs more than it gives.
